    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p><b>DESCRIPTION :</b> When transferring a mobile product from the source branch to the destination branch, the product quantity is transferred successfully, but the associated mobile serial numbers are not transferred. As a result, the transferred mobile product cannot be sold from the destination branch because its serial number is unavailable.</p>

<p><b>STEPS TO REPRODUCE</b> <b>:</b> <br/>
1.  Navigate to inventories , select the product (Mobile with serial)<br/>
2. Click the Transfer and select destination branch , enter the transfer quantity with serial.<br/>
3. Click the Transfer.<br/>
4. Navigate to the destination branch and check the transferred product's but Serial number is not Transferred.</p>

<p><b>Expected Result:</b><br/>
The product quantity and its associated mobile serial number(s) should be transferred successfully from the source to the destination warehouse/branch. The transferred serial number should be available for selection when creating a sales invoice at the destination.</p>

<p><b>Actual Result:</b><br/>
The product quantity is transferred successfully, but the associated mobile serial number is not transferred to the destination. Consequently, the product cannot be sold from the destination warehouse/branch.</p>

<p><b>Attachment</b> : <br/>
<a href="https://www.loom.com/share/6350cb61db1f4ee7a1be65781972c81b" title="smart-link" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://www.loom.com/share/6350cb61db1f4ee7a1be65781972c81b</a> </p>
            <br/>
